        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"data-engineering-notebook-for-the-government-of-canada-public-service-employee-survey-pses\">Data Engineering \ud83c\udf0a\ud83c\udf43 Notebook for the Government of Canada Public Service Employee Survey (PSES)</h1>\n<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">This notebook ingested and built an analytical dataset to display Public Service Employee Survey (PSES) results for longitudinal analysis across themes and sub-themes.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">It performed the following steps:</span>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Ingestion</strong>: Downloaded the raw PSES CSV and converted it into <a href=\"https://duckdb.org/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">DuckDB</a> format</li>\n<li><strong>Theme Mapping</strong>: Loaded the theme/indicator taxonomy from Subset 1 CSV<sup id=\"fnref:8-1\"><a class=\"footnote-ref\" href=\"#fn:8-1\">1</a></sup></li>\n<li><strong>Transformation</strong>: Created whole-of-government analytical tables</li>\n<li><strong>Statistical Analysis</strong>: Computed theme scores, year-over-year changes</li>\n</ol>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Output</strong>:</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">All tables were written to <code>data/pses.duckdb</code>. If you do not see sample data at <a href=\"#database-setup\">Section 2: Database Setup</a>, you can generate the database using this notebook.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Reproducibility</strong>:</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Any user can run this notebook using the following steps:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><em>insert instructions on uv and code execution</em></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Data Source</strong>:</span>\n<ul>\n<li>Main dataset: <a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/content/dam/tbs-sct/documents/datasets/ses-2025/main-principal.csv\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.canada.ca/content/dam/tbs-sct/documents/datasets/ses-2025/main-principal.csv</a></li>\n<li>Theme taxonomy: <a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/content/dam/tbs-sct/documents/datasets/ses-2025/subset-1-sous-ensemble-1.csv\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.canada.ca/content/dam/tbs-sct/documents/datasets/ses-2025/subset-1-sous-ensemble-1.csv</a></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"footnote\">\n<hr />\n<ol>\n<li id=\"fn:8-1\">This file contains characters out of range for the UTF-8 encoding. <a href=\"#annex\">Annex</a> contains the helper function that deals with the BOM-prefixed, Latin-1 encoded file in question.&#160;<a class=\"footnote-backref\" href=\"#fnref:8-1\" title=\"Jump back to footnote 1 in the text\">&#8617;</a></li>\n</ol>\n</div></span>"
          }
        }
